WEBVTT

00:01:58.251 --> 00:01:59.810
A chokehold!

00:02:12.399 --> 00:02:13.594
It almost looks like--

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:19.299
It almost looks like a father
carrying a child on his back...

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:26.646
"After the Dream”

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.680
Knock him out!

00:02:32.319 --> 00:02:36.499
What is it I want...?

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:38.267
His victory?

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.636
Baki's victory?

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.685
Or--

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.370
Baki!

00:03:05.986 --> 00:03:08.197
He broke free just like that!

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.600
He's good, all right...!

00:03:10.624 --> 00:03:13.685
He's world's strongest-- for a reason!

00:03:38.451 --> 00:03:40.112
Endorphins!

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:48.919
That's 2, no, 4 times
stronger than me...!

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:09.140
| have one thing to say to you.

00:04:12.853 --> 00:04:16.551
I'm enormously happy right now.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:21.904
That little snot who did nothing
but look up to me

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:25.374
is now attacking me
with everything he's got.

00:04:25.398 --> 00:04:28.845
His speed, weight, rhythm...

00:04:28.869 --> 00:04:33.204
They've all reached the
top level of modern fighting.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.270
His timing's good, too.

00:04:40.447 --> 00:04:45.795
He's making Baki's attacks
look like a baby's...!

00:04:45.819 --> 00:04:48.364
You all raised him!

00:04:48.388 --> 00:04:50.015
| thank you.

00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:56.105
| assume you all know
that strong men have a smell.

00:04:56.129 --> 00:04:57.707
A smell?

00:04:57.731 --> 00:05:03.346
You can search the world over and
still not come across a smell like this.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:05.930
It's my favorite aroma!

00:05:13.313 --> 00:05:17.181
Hey, Emi. It's feeding time.

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:23.352
I'm gonna eat today!

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:28.938
He's enjoying himself...!

00:05:28.962 --> 00:05:31.397
He seems so happy...!

00:05:33.867 --> 00:05:37.280
| figured he'd be a simple snack...

00:05:37.304 --> 00:05:39.170
Smile...!

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.966
To think he'd be this delectable...

00:05:44.811 --> 00:05:46.122
Baki...

00:05:46.146 --> 00:05:48.774
Tears...?

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:53.612
Make your father happy!

00:06:02.529 --> 00:06:04.759
I'tt make someone happy!

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:07.599
You, that is!

00:06:10.737 --> 00:06:12.432
Time to eat!

00:06:31.424 --> 00:06:32.858
He got pounded!

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:44.265
Where am I? It feels so nice...

00:06:46.206 --> 00:06:51.303
Huh? I've been here before...

00:06:52.212 --> 00:06:54.476
Where was it...?

00:06:56.383 --> 00:07:04.017
It was soft, and warm, and gentle...

00:07:08.361 --> 00:07:09.872
He got pounded!

00:07:09.896 --> 00:07:11.660
Not done yet!

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:19.648
Nice reaction, Baki.

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:23.919
That attack was
completely imperceptible!

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.622
Much like the ideal iai form...!

00:07:26.646 --> 00:07:28.224
Faster than a jab...!

00:07:28.248 --> 00:07:32.128
Looked like you were
dreaming for .2 seconds there.

00:07:32.152 --> 00:07:37.700
A fight between the very best is
a struggle for those decimal points.

00:07:37.724 --> 00:07:41.937
In other words, after you
smashed into the ground,

00:07:41.961 --> 00:07:45.124
I killed you twice.

00:07:47.901 --> 00:07:50.346
That stance...!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.348
That's--

00:07:52.372 --> 00:07:55.785
That's my old man's serious stance...!

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:58.554
--What the...?
--He shut his eyes!

00:07:58.578 --> 00:08:02.640
Is he planning to use the
technique he used on me?!

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:13.154
Gimme your best shot!

00:08:14.394 --> 00:08:16.522
Pathetic...

00:08:25.405 --> 00:08:26.998
No!

00:08:37.951 --> 00:08:42.431
He countered that spin kick...!

00:08:42.455 --> 00:08:44.219
That's it.

00:08:52.065 --> 00:08:56.161
--It's all over...
--Horrific...!

00:08:57.337 --> 00:08:59.362
Things look bleak...

00:09:13.953 --> 00:09:15.819
Are you trying to kill him?!

00:09:19.926 --> 00:09:23.038
If this keeps up, he'll be-- Madam!

00:09:23.062 --> 00:09:26.775
That's Hanma Yujiro!

00:09:26.799 --> 00:09:33.432
Once he gets started, he won't let up,
not even for his own son...

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:45.461
Only the winner's allowed stop a fight.

00:09:45.485 --> 00:09:48.477
Surely, you realize that too...

00:09:51.257 --> 00:09:53.335
THAT'S Yujiro...!

00:09:53.359 --> 00:09:55.259
He gets so immersed...!

00:09:58.698 --> 00:10:00.666
Madam...!

00:10:09.576 --> 00:10:12.011
I win...

00:10:23.823 --> 00:10:31.823
But if I beat him,
will you finally love me?

00:10:35.368 --> 00:10:39.771
--Love me...!
--Idiot!

00:10:45.878 --> 00:10:50.645
Just a tiny bit of your
love for him... Please...!

00:11:10.903 --> 00:11:13.031
I'm so stupid...!

00:11:22.282 --> 00:11:25.877
Yujiro!

00:11:28.588 --> 00:11:31.148
Now you fight me!

00:11:48.174 --> 00:11:51.633
Yujiro!

00:11:54.447 --> 00:11:56.792
Now you fight me!

00:11:56.816 --> 00:11:59.261
--Emi...!
--You're crazy...!

00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:00.912
Madam...!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.889
Emi!

00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:22.541
She'll be killed--

00:12:31.417 --> 00:12:33.044
She intends to die!

00:12:36.155 --> 00:12:40.217
To think you'd give up
womanhood for motherhood...

00:13:00.446 --> 00:13:04.440
Wow, that's nothing special at all...

00:13:28.841 --> 00:13:31.811
What a great woman...

00:14:55.695 --> 00:15:02.211
It's only natural. A 13-year old boy
fighting the Ogre...

00:15:02.235 --> 00:15:06.949
Anyone could've guessed
this would happen!

00:15:06.973 --> 00:15:09.465
Why wasn't he stopped?!

00:15:12.545 --> 00:15:17.159
Hanma-san. I can hardly imagine
how you are feeling right now.

00:15:17.183 --> 00:15:21.830
But things have gone
too far now to simply ignore.

00:15:21.854 --> 00:15:26.401
You can lessen your punishment by
turning yourself in, even for murder.

00:15:26.425 --> 00:15:29.292
| will accompany you
to the authorities.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.563
You finally got to see Hanma Yujiro!

00:15:54.587 --> 00:15:57.900
If you're sorry excuses
for fighters, too...

00:15:57.924 --> 00:16:00.916
---then have some fun with me!

00:16:50.209 --> 00:16:58.209
Good night...

00:16:59.051 --> 00:17:07.051
Sleep tight...

00:17:17.937 --> 00:17:25.937
My sweet little boy...

00:17:33.419 --> 00:17:41.419
Off to sleep you go...

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:54.165
Off to sleep... you go...

00:17:56.175 --> 00:18:03.206
Off to... sleep...

00:18:42.488 --> 00:18:45.434
Look, Mom! Everyone's staring!

00:18:45.458 --> 00:18:49.905
Is it that rare to see
a kid carrying his mom?

00:18:49.929 --> 00:18:54.662
They're just jealous
that we're so close!

00:18:55.501 --> 00:18:59.214
But we're family! Of course we're close!

00:18:59.238 --> 00:19:00.482
You sillyhead!

00:19:00.506 --> 00:19:03.885
Our closeness is a special one.

00:19:03.909 --> 00:19:05.638
That's for sure!

00:19:09.181 --> 00:19:12.861
But I've just started.
I still have so far to--

00:19:12.885 --> 00:19:16.598
Show off too much,
and people will hate you...

00:19:16.622 --> 00:19:19.468
I don't mind if people hate me...

00:19:19.492 --> 00:19:22.484
We're family, after all!

00:19:27.433 --> 00:19:29.411
What are you doing there?

00:19:29.435 --> 00:19:33.133
You're all banged up.
Were you in a fight?

00:19:38.711 --> 00:19:40.689
Officer.

00:19:40.713 --> 00:19:45.861
Please let me continue
just a little more...

00:19:45.885 --> 00:19:48.081
Just a little more...!

00:19:49.488 --> 00:19:52.167
Continue what...?

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:54.669
Hey...!

00:19:54.693 --> 00:19:56.972
--Detective Kido!
--Let him be.

00:19:56.996 --> 00:20:01.092
--Huh? But--
--Just do it.

00:20:04.003 --> 00:20:06.214
--Kido-san.
--What?

00:20:06.238 --> 00:20:09.684
<i>Where do you suppose he'll go now?</i>

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:12.234
Ain't it obvious?

00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:15.772
Baki...

00:20:43.576 --> 00:20:45.020
It's me.

00:20:45.044 --> 00:20:48.207
Master Baki! Where are you...?!

00:20:49.048 --> 00:20:51.210
Two years.

00:20:53.018 --> 00:20:57.751
I'll return to Japan in two years. I'm--

00:21:09.568 --> 00:21:13.348
I'm going to get strong enough
to beat him bare-handed!

00:21:13.372 --> 00:21:16.751
Please take care of yourself...

00:21:16.775 --> 00:21:19.437
Yeah. You too.

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:50.578
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:50.602 --> 00:22:56.184
hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.856
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:06.861
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:12.400
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:12.424 --> 00:23:17.939
gently enveloped in love

00:23:17.963 --> 00:23:23.611
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.635 --> 00:23:29.150
but they will be reborn

00:23:29.174 --> 00:23:34.823
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.847 --> 00:23:40.945
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:50.329 --> 00:23:52.195
"Next Episode”

00:23:56.068 --> 00:23:58.279
At some point in the boy's 13 years,

00:23:58.303 --> 00:24:03.918
the existence he kept chasing became
a source of anger and resentment.

00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:10.458
What did he lose- and gain-
when he took fate into his own hands?

00:24:10.482 --> 00:24:15.196
The many fists that passed by
are now bonds that bring strength.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:20.090
"Next Episode: Him"
